Similarly,  Hong  and  co-workers  fabricated  Ru-based hierarchical porous carbon for overall water splitting (Fig. 6(a)) [72]. The prepared \(\mathrm{HP-Ru/C}\) had a unique hierarchical pore network,  including  abundant  micro/meso/macropores,  which significantly promoted the exposure of active sites and transfer of charge/mass. In addition, Yang's group provided different routes to prepare \(\mathrm{Ru/RuO}_{2}\) nanoparticles supported hierarchical porous
